      "coverage": "covered",
      "text": [
        "Proof of FPK Equation",
        "By the previously derived infinitesimal generator:",
        "𝜕𝜙 𝑥     1                𝜕 ) 𝜙(𝑥)",
        "* ℒ𝜙 𝑥 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡 𝑑𝑥 = * 𝜇 𝑥, 𝑡 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡      𝑑𝑥 + 𝜎 𝑥, 𝑡 )𝑝(𝑥, 𝑡)      )   𝑑𝑥",
        "ℝ                                  𝜕𝑥      2                  𝜕𝑥",
        "Resulting adjoint operator:",
        "𝜕                    1 𝜕)",
        "* 𝜙 𝑥 ℒ ∗ 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡 𝑑𝑥 = * 𝜙 𝑥      −    𝜇 𝑥, 𝑡 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡   +        𝜎 𝑥, 𝑡 ) 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡   𝑑𝑥 .",
        "ℝ                         ℝ       𝜕𝑥                   2 𝜕𝑥 )"
      ],
      "media_sha256": [
        "56e0d2e7eb5c460e0ad459425958353b747bf9784dafc4b56fb4e3e8fca89de3"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "slide": 36,
      "pptx_slide": 36,
      "title": "Proof of FPK Equation",
      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "covered",
      "text": [
        "Proof of FPK Equation",
        "We proved that, for all 𝜙 𝑥 ,",
        "𝜕",
        "*𝜙 𝑥    𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡 𝑑𝑥 = * 𝜙 𝑥 ℒ ∗ 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡 𝑑𝑥 .",
        "ℝ    𝜕𝑡              ℝ",
        "Then we arrive at the FPK equation:",
        "𝜕𝑝(𝑥, 𝑡)    𝜕                    1 𝜕)          ) 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡 .",
        "=−    𝜇 𝑥, 𝑡 𝑝 𝑥, 𝑡   +        𝜎 𝑥, 𝑡",
        "𝜕𝑡        𝜕𝑥                   2 𝜕𝑥 )"
      ],
      "media_sha256": [
        "7cc521da2e2f1e79514c51398c5c836ce9e05f72e1c4d7407cd3ff847037669c"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "slide": 37,
      "pptx_slide": 37,
      "title": "End of Slide",
      "classification": "transition-only",
      "coverage": "covered",
      "text": [
        "End of Slide",
        "Multi-dimensional generalization is conceptually straightforward.",
        "Other useful concepts (not the scope of this lecture):",
        "• Girsanov theorem (change of measures for SDEs)",
        "• Feynman–Kac formula (importance sampling for SDEs)",
        "• Doob’s ℎ-Transform (dynamic version of Bayes rule for SDEs)",
        "Read the book for more! https://users.aalto.fi/~asolin/sde-book/sde-book.pdf"
      ],
      "media_sha256": [
        "13605043260d47294e83cab0208c54cb53ce0c812f68354ae6647484ee66f36a"
